WEBVTT

00:06:59.748 --> 00:07:01.375
giving up hope --

00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:02.585
only relinquishes power

00:07:02.585 --> 00:07:05.880
into the very entities
that have gotten us into this mess.

00:07:06.922 --> 00:07:09.467
Luckily, I’m not alone
in championing this movement.

00:07:09.925 --> 00:07:12.136
My friends at EcoTok
provide a great example

00:07:12.136 --> 00:07:13.971
of a diverse set of backgrounds,

00:07:13.971 --> 00:07:14.972
experiences

00:07:14.972 --> 00:07:18.851
and voices coming together
to encourage this generation and the next.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.145
Here's a look at some of our work.

00:07:22.438 --> 00:07:25.900
(Video) Doria Brown: Canada is banning
six types of plastics.

00:07:26.025 --> 00:07:28.694
The plastics include grocery bags,

00:07:28.694 --> 00:07:29.737
stir sticks,

00:07:29.737 --> 00:07:30.946
six-pack rings,